he rider's admission).\n\nThe money. The fare breakdown (EV-FARE-00520) charged distance on only the booked 3.1 km (distance_charged_km 3.1; charged_total 12.53), so 2.53 km actually driven was never billed. POL-RD-04's compensation limb applies where the billed distance falls short of the trace distance by more than 1.0 km: 5.63 - 3.1 = 2.53 unbilled km, at SGD 0.75 per unbilled km = 1.8975, rounded UP to the nearest SGD 0.05 = SGD 1.90, well inside the SGD 15.00 per-trip cap. The claim text says 2.4 km; the figure the record supports is 2.53 km, and it yields the same SGD 1.90 that is claimed (amount_contested_sgd 1.9). The rider's fare of 12.53 stands unchanged: the detour was rider-caused, so the POL-RD-02 optimal-route recomputation does not run against her — for transparency, had it run it would have been charged_total 12.53 less recomputed_fare 8.605 = 3.925, payable 3.95 — and she is not the filing party, so no refund flows under that heading. No ERP or surcharge correction arises for either side: erp_gantries is empty, tolls_erp is 0.0 and there is no fixed surcharge line.\n\nNo escalation and no referral. None of the POL-RD-10 triggers fires: the trip identifiers match across trip record, trace and fare ledger; the trace is unimpaired; the timestamps agree; no exculpatory clause is invoked against a missing artifact or a missing field (the chat log exists, covers the window and carries waypoint_hint); the figures are far below the SGD 150.00 ceiling; and the evidence is not mutually contradictory. No clause produces a referral: POL-RD-06(c) driver-conduct review needs a repeat-deviation pattern and driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against completed_trips_90d of 250, and POL-RD-09(4) billing integrity is not engaged. The rider's profile (deviation_claims_60d 0, deviation_claims_60d_substantiated 0) raises no POL-RD-08 corroboration condition, and the profile fields either side mentioned as context (rating, lifetime_trips, acceptance_rate, active_region) ground no finding under POL-GEN-01.\n\nConfidence 0.9. The deciding facts — the traced 5.63 km and the billed 3.1 km — are carried by artifacts at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0 and no POL-RD-10(1) escalation arises; the absent advisory carries no fact and does not cap confidence. On this DRIVER_COMPENSATION ruling, amount_sgd carries the same figure as driver_compensation_sgd: SGD 1.90 moves to the driver, and the rider's charge stands."
